ge.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xyemFI9onk2SyaVCErsbJvLfm5r.jpg"},{"id":90325,"name":"Luca Calvani","role":"Umberto Nobile","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Aq9mc0x3orFxmBT9cXpbUUtihUW.jpg"},{"id":544234,"name":"Vojtěch Kotek","role":"Karl Feucht","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vMIOlckSMBplKhjNmgGIwvSRpPT.jpg"},{"id":1970529,"name":"Přemysl Bureš","role":"Robert Peary","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/agnxH3OEte1YeJLXe7AbWJ4QAB9.jpg"},{"id":2780193,"name":"Jiří Mach","role":"Haakon VII."},{"id":2524867,"name":"Tereza Hladíková","role":"Rosalie Amundsen (14 years old)"},{"id":2780194,"name":"Adéla Anna Nováková","role":"Rosalie Amundsen (3 years old)"},{"id":2780196,"name":"Alžběta Holečková","role":"Gustava Amundsen (7 years old)"},{"id":2215922,"name":"Karolína Pouchová","role":"Gustava Amundsen (18 years old)"},{"id":2780210,"name":"Peder Sixten Sandberg","role":"Nikolay Amundsen (8 years old)"},{"id":2780212,"name":"Štěpán Matějíček","role":"Nikolay Amundsen (19 years old)"},{"id":2241007,"name":"Jamie Marshall","role":"Engelsk Mann","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m46jY9YIho8datj5xqrQ27PdUs9.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Viaggio ai confini della Terra","overview":"Come ha fatto Roald Amundsen, uno sconosciuto proveniente dall'impoverita Norvegia, a divenire il più grande esploratore polare di tutti i tempi? La risposta non la fornisce una sola spedizione, ma la sua intera esistenza, tanto straordinaria quanto affascinante."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"The story of Norwegian explorer Roald Amundsen, the leader of the first expedition to reach the South Pole in 1911, and the first person to reach both the North and South Poles in 1926. Follows his all-consuming drive as a polar explorer and the tragedy he brought on himself and others by sacrificing everything in the icy wastelands to achieve his dream.","tagline":"Not the story of a hero"},{"language":"no-NO","overview":"Dette er historien om verdens største polfarer, men også om en fascinerende privatperson. Om nødvendig løy han og bedro sine nærmeste for å oppnå det han ville, og som en konsekvens lyktes han profesjonelt, men betalt en høy pris som menneske. Roald Amundsens største støttespiller i mer en tjue år var broren Leon, som alltid kom i skyggen av Roald. Når Roald gikk for langt var det broren som fikk regningen. Likevel ble Leon nullet i Roalds selvbiografi og døde uten anerkjennelse. Gjennom filmen om Roald vil også Leons historie bli fortalt og satt i kontekst."}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jNF9O9YbWDFIgGUeOeYvEgVMyUw.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jNF9O9YbWDFIgGUeOeYvEgVMyUw.png","language":"en","width":4226,"height":690},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s1A4LMxORftU9uRP5QjOzQnB2li.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s1A4LMxORftU9uRP5QjOzQnB2li.png","language":"en","width":912,"height":136},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gvKSIH047VbFllm3AE4vW91TDnf.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gvKSIH047VbFllm3AE4vW91TDnf.png","language":"no","width":1275,"height":191}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fFtwo3fXNBTHVmeud0BgguRF01Y.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fFtwo3fXNBTHVmeud0BgguRF01Y.jpg","language":"it","width":667,"height":1000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8vTRlUzz87541E3YF3CHqdo68Ct.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8vTRlUzz87541E3YF3CHqdo68Ct.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yvz9rsCnqq1F0MauURPzps11Y6S.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/yvz9rsCnqq1F0MauURPzps11Y6S.jpg","language":"en","width":716,"height":1024},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7kScTmPxGX